<title>ITALY: Milan Fib30 futures screen prices back to normal.</title>
<headline>Milan Fib30 futures screen prices back to normal.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The &quot;last&quot; price quoted on screens for Fib30 Milan bourse index futures is being updated again in real time now that a technical problem has been fixed, the Bourse Council said.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
